# Marketplace Extraction & Shopify OS 2.0 Ingestion Patterns

## 1. Multi-Tier Extraction Architecture

When importing products from high-friction e-commerce marketplaces (AliExpress, Best Buy, Taobao, Reverb):

| Tier | Mechanism | Best Use Case | Reference Repositories |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Tier 1: Official / Partner API** | Direct OpenAPI / RPC with dev tokens | Real-time stock / price checks, automated order placement | `moh3a/ae_sdk` (TypeScript, `openservice.aliexpress.com`), `sergioteula/python-aliexpress-api` |
| **Tier 2: Async Dataset & MCP Servers** | Trigger -> Poll progress -> Fetch JSON snapshot OR direct MCP tools | Bulk catalogue ingestion (1k-50k items), zero IP ban risk, or agentic tool use | `customcoder245/bestbuy` (`https://api.brightdata.com/datasets/v3`), `brightdata/brightdata-mcp` (2,694⭐, 32 tools), `GeLi2001/shopify-mcp` (239⭐, GraphQL 2026-01) |
| **Tier 3: Stealth CDP / FastMCP & Browser Profiles** | Headless Chrome with stealth flags + patchright OR persistent browser profiles | Live interactive single-product checks, bypassing Cloudflare, Akamai, or Taobao `x5sec` | `omkarcloud/aliexpress-scraper` (Python, 64 countries), `limengwork/1688MCP` (Go + Rod, persistent session), `fanqi99-creator/taobao-mcp-server` (Playwright + persistent profile + OAuth 2.1) |

## 2. Best Buy Dataset API v3 Pipeline & Pricing (from customcoder245/bestbuy)
1. **Trigger Collection**: `POST https://api.brightdata.com/datasets/v3/trigger?dataset_id={dataset_id}&include_errors=true` with JSON body `[{"url": "...", "country": "us"}]` or `[{"keyword": "..."}]`. Returns `snapshot_id`.
2. **Poll Status**: `GET https://api.brightdata.com/datasets/v3/progress/{snapshot_id}` every 5-10s until `status == "ready"`.
3. **Stream Snapshot**: `GET https://api.brightdata.com/datasets/v3/snapshot/{snapshot_id}?format=json` (supports standard JSON or NDJSON stream).
4. **Landed-Cost Pricing Engine**:
   $$\text{Price}_{\text{retail}} = \Big(\big(\text{Price}_{\text{source}} + (\text{Weight}_{\text{kg}} \cdot \text{Rate}_{\text{shipping}} + \text{Handling}_{\text{fixed}})\big) \cdot \text{FX}\Big) \cdot (1 + \text{Margin})$$
   - Weight normalization: converts imperial units (`lbs`, `oz`) to kg via regex before calculating freight.
   - Metafields mapping: packs deep technical specs into namespace `custom`, key `bestbuy_specs` (JSON stringified).

## 3. SOTA 2026 MCP Importer Architecture for dnk_shopify
- **Ingestion**: Use `brightdata/brightdata-mcp` for western retail (Amazon, Best Buy, Walmart) and `omkarcloud/aliexpress-scraper` + `limengwork/1688MCP` / `fanqi99-creator/taobao-mcp-server` for Chinese source catalogs.
- **Shopify Sync**: Replace legacy REST API 2024-01 with **GraphQL Admin API 2026-01** (`GeLi2001/shopify-mcp` patterns) supporting Dev Dashboard OAuth Client Credentials.
- **Idempotency**: SQLite WAL cache storing `source_id -> shopify_product_gid` and SHA-256 payload hashes to prevent duplicate calls and rate-limiting.

## 3. Shopify OS 2.0 Metafield Transformation
- **Pre-Registration**: Use `metafieldDefinitionCreate` GraphQL mutation beforehand in namespace `custom` for public PDP specs and `supplier` for private fulfillment specs.
- **Payload Mapping**:
  ```graphql
  mutation productCreate($input: ProductInput!) {
    productCreate(input: $input) {
      product {
        id
        metafields(first: 10) { edges { node { key value } } }
      }
    }
  }
  ```
- **Media Ingestion**: Never keep hotlinks to supplier CDN images. Use Shopify Admin API `stagedUploadsCreate` to host assets directly on Shopify Files CDN (`cdn.shopify.com`).
